    <div id=3D"step0">
      <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
      <ul style=3D"list-style-type: none;">
        <li>
          Make sure that your Android application meets the following requi=
rements before proceeding.
          <div class=3D"alert alert-primary">
            <ul>
              <li>
                Android 4.2.2 (Jelly Bean, API 17) and higher. MRAID ads re=
quire API 19 and higher.<br>
                <strong>Older Android versions may work, but are not offici=
ally supported.</strong>
              </li>
              <li>
                Google Play Services will adhere to the user=92s ad trackin=
g preferences. For more information, please see
                <a href=3D"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-de=
veloper/answer/6048248?hl=3Den">Google's website</a> regarding their Advert=
ising ID.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              <strong>Note</strong>: if you are using Android Studio 3.0+, =
you'll need to disable AAPT 2.0.=20
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            To do this, you'll need to add the following to your gradle.pro=
perties:<br>
            android.enableAapt2=3Dfalse
          </li>
       =20
      </ul>
    </div>
