atest version of the Android platform. Android P onwards apps make connecti=
ons over HTTPS by default. Though InMobi supports the adoption of HTTPS, th=
e current setup requires our demand partners to support HTTPS as well. The =
publisher can change their settings to HTTP if it has an impact on the reve=
nue potential.
