                    <td>This event will return a BuyerName as well as a Buy=
erPrice for the loaded ad.</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>AD_LOADED</td>
                    <td>Ad has been loaded</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>PRELOAD_READY</td>
                    <td>Ad has been preloaded</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>VC_READY</td>
                    <td>This event communicates the Virtual Currency (VC) n=
ame, amount, buyer name, and buyer price of the loaded ad.
